{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50782","headline":"观潮十韵 · 张祜","name":"观潮十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泯泯顺爲回，泙泙逆是来。\n草微淹泽莽，沙涨积云堆。\n不止灵威怒，当慿恠力推。\n夏天江叠雪，晴日海奔雷。\n近落痕犹浅，初平势渐开。\n舟惊浮浩渺，石看打崔嵬。\n鸟下愁滩没，人行畏岸颓。\n鼓风连涵澹，值洑更旋回。\n进退随蟾魄，虚盈合蚌胎。\n何妨俾巨浸，爲尔济川才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}